SUMMARY:Ski Day in Engelberg - Titlis ⛷️
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/ski-day-engelberg/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.bergfex.ch/engelberg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Engelberg Titlis</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/jFTWssNRqMZUywXw5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form</a>\n\n<p>Join us for a day of skiing in the beautiful Urner Alps! We will ski in the Engelberg - Titlis area.</p> <p><strong>Estimated price: 101.20 CHF</strong> via <a class="link" href="https://freizeit.sbb.ch/de/stories/snownrail-engelberg-titlis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SBB</a> (Back and Forth Train Ticket + Ski Ticket included)</p> <h2 id="travel">Travel</h2> <p>You need to book the travel <strong>yourself</strong>, individually. The following options are available (at the time of writing):</p> <p>From Zurich to Engelberg - Titlis:</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAADCAIAAAAcOLh5AAAAgklEQVR4nGzMQQrCMBQE0PlJ/ZRCuii47zH04L2GnqBHKFJsgrHmjxB152N2w0yz3PPrcj3GZTudRRWkVviH5DRNKSUAXdfJbd3WeQ7liXGEcwB8ZWalFOec9/47rWnbNlfDMEjODzbNwXkB5HdPMlWq2vc9SZFPCTOLMe77HkJ4DwBPc0MFNgVbyAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_584d5aaf643d7a36.webp 938w, /images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_584d5aaf643d7a36.webp 938w, /images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_90eb09fcd43daae9.webp 640w'                     sizes="(max-width: 938px) 100vw, 938px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_d9719e09ce264b40.jpg 938w, /images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_d9719e09ce264b40.jpg 938w, /images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_b718b836584a12e5.jpg 640w'                     sizes="(max-width: 938px) 100vw, 938px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2025-02-07-ski-day-engelberg/train1_hu_d9719e09ce264b40.jpg"                  width="938"                  height="158"                                                                                     /></picture> <p>From Engelberg - Titlis to Zurich:</p>
